## Best Practices

### 1. Theo dõi Quota Hàng ngày

```
Dashboard shows:
- GLM quota: 75% used (reset in 6h)
- MiniMax quota: 50% used (reset in 2h)
- Kimi quota: 8M/10M used (reset in 15 days)

Plan heavy tasks around reset times!
```

### 2. Dùng Coding Plan (GLM)

```
