Coding Plan: 3× quota (same price!)

→ Always choose Coding Plan
```

### 3. Kết hợp với Free Tier

```
Combo:
1. gc/gemini-3-flash (FREE primary)
2. glm/glm-4.7 (cheap backup)
3. minimax/MiniMax-M2.1 (cheapest)
