## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Runtime**: Node.js 20+
- **Framework**: Next.js 16
- **UI**: React 19 + Tailwind 4
- **Database**: LowDB (dựa trên tệp JSON)
- **Streaming**: Server-Sent Events (SSE)
- **Auth**: OAuth 2.0 (PKCE) + JWT + API Keys

